  "answer": "For your medium-haul flight that arrived 4 hours late, you are eligible for compensation of EUR 350. This is because, according to Corvina Airways' policy, a medium-haul arrival delay of 3 hours or more entitles you to EUR 350. Note that this compensation is only applicable if the delay was caused by circumstances within Corvina's control, which applies in this case. You must submit your claim through the online form within 12 months of the flight date to receive the compensation by bank transfer or as a travel voucher worth 130% of the amount, valid for 12 months.",
  "policy_covers_question": true
